/// Base module for a patch to an existing, already-typed `K8sResource` registered in an app's
/// `generate.patches`.
/// A concrete patch file `amends` this module and overrides [patch] with a `Mixin` for its specific
/// resource type (e.g. `Mixin<Deployment>`), using ordinary object-amendment syntax for its body directly.
open module manifest.Patch

patch: Mixin
